note 08_voting_eligibility.vss — Voting & Age Eligibility Checker
task check_voting needs age, citizen
    when age at_least 18 and citizen same_as yes
        say "Eligible to vote"
    otherwise
        say "Not eligible to vote"
    finish
finish

check_voting(20, yes)
check_voting(16, yes)
check_voting(22, no)
